======== STEP: Calculate coverage by layer (architecture gates) ========
##[group]Run chmod +x scripts/test/calculate_layer_coverage.sh
^[[36;1mchmod +x scripts/test/calculate_layer_coverage.sh^[[0m
^[[36;1m^[[0m
^[[36;1m# --github-output emits ONLY key=value lines. The previous version^[[0m
^[[36;1m# appended the script's human summary too, so prose like^[[0m
^[[36;1m# "Summary of coverage by layer" became a step-output key (#39).^[[0m
^[[36;1m./scripts/test/calculate_layer_coverage.sh --github-output coverage/lcov.info \^[[0m
^[[36;1m  >> "$GITHUB_OUTPUT"^[[0m
^[[36;1m^[[0m
^[[36;1m# And print the readable form for whoever is reading the log.^[[0m
^[[36;1m./scripts/test/calculate_layer_coverage.sh coverage/lcov.info^[[0m
shell: /usr/bin/bash -e {0}
env:
  FLUTTER_ROOT: /opt/hostedtoolcache/flutter/stable-3.47.4-x64/flutter
  PUB_CACHE: /home/runner/.pub-cache
##[endgroup]
Coverage by layer (percentage of executable lines covered):
  Domain:       100.0%
  Data:         96.0%
  Presentation: 95.4%
  Core:         85.1%

======== STEP: Calculate coverage metrics ========
##[group]Run # Overall coverage
^[[36;1m# Overall coverage^[[0m
^[[36;1mOVERALL=$(lcov --summary coverage/lcov.info 2>&1 | grep "lines.*:" | head -1 | grep -oP '\d+\.\d+%' | head -1 | sed 's/%//' || echo "0")^[[0m
^[[36;1m^[[0m
^[[36;1m# File counts, kept only as context. They are NOT coverage - labelling^[[0m
^[[36;1m# them "Domain files: 15" beside a percentage is what made issue #25^[[0m
^[[36;1m# look like a real defect. Per-layer percentages come from the^[[0m
^[[36;1m# layer_coverage step above.^[[0m
^[[36;1mDOMAIN_FILES=$(grep -c "^SF:.*lib/features/.*/domain" coverage/lcov.info || echo "0")^[[0m
^[[36;1mDATA_FILES=$(grep -c "^SF:.*lib/features/.*/data" coverage/lcov.info || echo "0")^[[0m
^[[36;1mPRESENTATION_FILES=$(grep -c "^SF:.*lib/features/.*/presentation" coverage/lcov.info || echo "0")^[[0m
^[[36;1mCORE_FILES=$(grep -c "^SF:.*lib/core" coverage/lcov.info || echo "0")^[[0m
^[[36;1m^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "overall=$OVERALL" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "domain_files=$DOMAIN_FILES" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "data_files=$DATA_FILES" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "presentation_files=$PRESENTATION_FILES" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "core_files=$CORE_FILES" >> $GITHUB_OUTPUT^[[0m
^[[36;1m^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "📊 Overall line coverage: ${OVERALL}%"^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho ""^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "Source files measured per layer (counts, not coverage):"^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "  domain: ${DOMAIN_FILES}   data: ${DATA_FILES}   presentation: ${PRESENTATION_FILES}   core: ${CORE_FILES}"^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "Per-layer coverage percentages are reported by the"^[[0m
^[[36;1mecho "'Calculate coverage by layer (architecture gates)' step above."^[[0m
shell: /usr/bin/bash -e {0}
env:
  FLUTTER_ROOT: /opt/hostedtoolcache/flutter/stable-3.47.4-x64/flutter
  PUB_CACHE: /home/runner/.pub-cache
##[endgroup]
📊 Overall line coverage: 89.9%

Source files measured per layer (counts, not coverage):
  domain: 15   data: 12   presentation: 11   core: 70
Per-layer coverage percentages are reported by the
